Sequence Down
node U "User" pill
node App "Desktop app" box
node API "Auth API" box
node DB "DB" box
message U -> App Sync "Click Sign in"
message App -> API Sync "POST /session"
message API -> DB Sync "check code"
message DB -> API Reply "valid"
message API -> App Reply "200 token"
message API -> App Reply "401"
message App -> U Async "Signed in"
note over App,API before 2 "TLS, retried with the same key"
note over U before 7 "done"
